Package: tractoverse
Title: The Tractoverse: A Collection of R Packages for Diffusion MRI Tractography
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        given = "Aymeric",
        family = "Stamm",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        email = "aymeric.stamm@cnrs.fr",
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8725-3654")
    ))
Description: A curated collection of R packages for the analysis of diffusion
    MRI tractography data, inspired by the 'tidyverse'. This meta-package
    installs and attaches the tractoverse family: 'fiber' (data structures),
    'master' (simulation of streamlines and microstructural attributes),
    'rtists' (interactive 3D visualization), 'riot' (input/output), 'toad'
    (Tractography Open Atlases Data, reference datasets) and 'bot' (bundle
    optimal transport). It also ships the shared tractoverse brand (colors,
    theme, logos) as the single source of truth reused by the individual
    package websites and applications.
